      "evidence": ".observe/otel-instrumentation.md:135-154 leaves multiple numeric/enum branches future-only. Its certificate row says HTTP does not use TLS certificates, but installed loadEnvTLS constructs TLS configuration and newHTTPClient rejects its combination with the selected insecure endpoint, disabling local log export.",
